<title>FRANCE: CGT union arm reiterates Fr Telecom sale objection.</title>
<headline>CGT union arm reiterates Fr Telecom sale objection.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The post and telecommunications arm of the French Communist-led CGT union on Friday reiterated its opposition to the opening up of France Telecom's capital.</p>
<p>CGT national leader has said on several occasions he is opposed to a stake sale in France Telecom.</p>
<p>&quot;The opening up of France Telecom's capital should not just be suspended by halted definitively,&quot; the union's post and telecoms division said.</p>
<p>It also repeated its opposition to any attempt to privatise the Post Office.</p>
<p>Several other unions or union leaders have said they are not hostile to opening up France Telecom's capital to private investors.</p>
</text>
